  "content": [
    {
      "text": "I revoke not the judgments which I shall pass, D&C 19:5. I, the Lord, command and revoke, as it seemeth me good, D&C 56:4. I revoke and they receive not the blessing, D&C 58:32. destroyer rideth … and I revoke not the decree, D&C 61:19. I revoke the commission which I gave unto him, D&C 75:6.",
